{"slug":"ron-dellums","qid":"Q1870154","name":"Ron Dellums","desc":"American politician and former Mayor of Oakland, CA (1935–2018)","article":"Ron Dellums","born":"1935-11-24","died":"2018-07-30","birthplace":"Oakland","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-09","f":1993,"u":1998},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-08","f":1975,"u":1993},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"CA-07","f":1971,"u":1975}],"summary":"Ronald Vernie Dellums (November 24, 1935 – July 30, 2018) was an American politician who served as Mayor of Oakland from 2007 to 2011. Previously, served in the U.S. House of Representatives, representing California's 9th congressional district from 1971 to 1998, after which he worked as a lobbyist in Washington, D.C. Before that, he was on the Berkeley City Council from 1967 to 1970. He was a member of the Democratic Party.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"CA-09","p":"D","v":154806,"s":77.03,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"CA-09","p":"D","v":129233,"s":72.25,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"CA-09","p":"D","v":164265,"s":71.9,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":119645,"s":61.3,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":163221,"s":66.57,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1986,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":121790,"s":60.01,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1984,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":144316,"s":60.33,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1982,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":121537,"s":55.95,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1980,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":108380,"s":55.46,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1978,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":94824,"s":57.36,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"},{"y":1976,"o":"H","k":"CA-08","p":"D","v":122342,"s":62.12,"w":true,"n":"Ronald V Dellums"}]}